                                                              "take":  "This is a sharply timed critique as the AI startup wave mints new unicorns weekly. Damodaran\u0027s framework exposes a structural flaw: the current VC model rewards the appearance of scaling, not the reality of a business. For public market investors, the practical takeaway is to treat IPO filings with extreme skepticismÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â‚¬Âa high revenue growth rate with no path to profitability is not a Field of Dreams story, it may already be a Field of Nightmares by the time retail money touches it.",
                                                              "isNew":  true
